Data Wrangling Overview

Column Outcome
1.  True ASDS:  the booster successfully landed to a drone ship
2.  None None
3.  True RTLS
4.  False ASDS: the mission outcome was unsuccessfully landed to a drone ship
5.  True Ocean
6.  None ASDS
7.  False Ocean
8.  False RTLS

Outcome will like be converted to Classes y (either 0 or 1):
>  0 is a bad outcome, that is, the booster did not land.
>  1 is a good outcome, that is, the booster did land. 
The variable Y will represent the classification variable that represents the outcome of each launch. 

